    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This powerful Chaos Golem was made from Star Stones gathered from the Ruins of Pavel by the mad scientist Dr. Chaos, who styles himself the Emperor of Evil. Once a Golem Maestro, Dr. Chaos was expelled from the Black Anvil Guild for trying to steal the blueprint from the elders. He swore revenge on the Black Anvil Guild, conquering the Ruins of Pavel with the Horrifying Golem Army he created. He views all outsiders as assassins sent by the Guild and will attack immediately. His ultimate goal is 'world domination.'. Magic Creatures Lv. 2 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Magic Creatures. P. Def. +5% Max HP +3% Received Critical Damage -10% Received M. Crit. Damage -10% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Dagger/Rapier Resistance Lv. 5 Resistant to Dagger/Rapier attacks. Greater Bleed Resistance Lv. 5 Bleed Immunity. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
